            "description": "SETUP FIRST (Git Bash, project folder):\n\ndocker run --rm -d --name test-mcp-down -p 8081:8080 --env-file .env -e MCP_URL=http://127.0.0.1:9/mcp research-summarizer-agent-research-summarizer\n\nWait about 15 s for startup, then send.\n\nExpected: 200, searchSource WEB. The app started even though the MCP server is unreachable (@Lazy), and the request fell back to web. Docker Desktop > test-mcp-down > Logs shows 'MCP failed (...), falling back to web'.\n\nAfterwards: docker stop test-mcp-down",
